    [
      "Shared prizes are separate rows.",
      "Thirteen years split the award — each winner gets its own row and says so. Unanimous wins carry the article's own marker."
    ],
    [
      "The 1939 festival that never was.",
      "Cannes was to debut in 1939 and was cancelled by the war; in 2002 a jury watched the surviving competition entries and voted Union Pacific a retrospective Palme. It is a footnote, not a row."
